        "id": 29606,
        "name": "logan_mann",
        "username": "logan_mann",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/43a26b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-06T20:13:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So we have additional tokens, some of which will be different in then those in the EE, as a future stretch goal on the Shattered Timelines kickstarter. Elsewhere in this thread was an idea for a set of numbered tokens to track the order cards were put out (1, 2, 3...) as one example of additional tokens. What tokens would you find useful that we don't already have?</p><p>Also, looking at the graphic above from Christopher...there is a Use an Additional Power token pictured.&nbsp; I just double checked my set.&nbsp; I don't see any of those.&nbsp; Were they taken out before printing?&nbsp; Am I blind?</p>",
