        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-06T20:18:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My guess is that the 'use an additional power' was removed because it was uneven (all the tokens have two sides, each side containing one of the effects, and pairing the same effects together), and the other extra related effects to 'use an additional power' (i.e. 'play an additional card' and 'draw an additional card') were not on the list, making it the oddball one.</p><p>My guess anyway.</p>",
